==Russian==
===Etymology===
Possibly from English [[Vauxhall]] or from German [[Volk]] + [[Saal]] or from Dutch [[volk]] + [[zaal]] (people’s hall).

===Noun===
'''вокзал''' (vokzál) {{m}}

# [[train station]], [[railroad station]], [[railway station]], [[depot]]


